<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>My Own Worst Enemy</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lit</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">A Place In The Sun</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">33iv3wnGMrrDugd7GBso1z</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.900" end="00:21.390">Can we forget about the things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.390" end="00:22.890">I said when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.140" end="00:24.690">I was drunk?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.690" end="00:28.290">I didn't mean to call you that.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.290" end="00:31.980">I can't remember what was said or what you threw at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.980" end="00:33.480">Please tell me,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.490" end="00:40.490">Please tell me why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.620" end="00:45.690">My car is in the front yard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.690" end="00:50.040">And I'm sleeping with my clothes on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.040" end="00:51.540">I came in through the window last night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.300" end="00:59.300">And you're gone gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.370" end="01:07.560">It's no surprise to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.560" end="01:10.140">I am my own worst enemy, '</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.140" end="01:11.850">Cause every now and then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.850" end="01:14.790">I kick the living shit out of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.790" end="01:19.500">The smoke alarm is going off and there's a cigarette</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.500" end="01:21.000">Still burning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.250" end="01:26.970">Please tell me why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.970" end="01:28.680">My car is in the front yard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.680" end="01:32.640">And I'm sleeping with my clothes on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.640" end="01:37.530">I came in through the window last night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.530" end="01:39.030">And you're gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.800" end="01:45.800">Gone Please tell me why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.360" end="02:10.860">My car is in the front yard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.380" end="02:13.350">And I'm sleeping with my clothes on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.350" end="02:20.490">I came in through the window last night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.490" end="02:22.230">It's no surprise to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.230" end="02:23.730">I am my own worst enemy '</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.740" end="02:26.010">Cause every now and then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.010" end="02:28.770">I kick the living shit out of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.770" end="02:31.230">Can we forget about the the things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.230" end="02:32.730">I said when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.980" end="02:34.200">I was drunk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.200" end="02:38.200">I didn't mean to call you that</p></div></body></tt>